## Engineering Reference A

This one will contain

```text
MarketingPlatform
│
├── docker
│
│   Purpose
│   Container infrastructure.
│
├── renderer
│
│   Purpose
│   Rendering Service.
│
├── docs
│
│   Purpose
│   Engineering knowledge.
│
└── README
```

---

## Engineering Reference B

This is the masterpiece.

Every important file gets its own page.

Example

---

### server.js

Purpose

Acts as the Renderer Service entry point.

Responsibilities

* Exposes `/render`
* Receives Creative Brief
* Coordinates rendering pipeline
* Returns poster

Consumes

```text
HTTP Request
```

Produces

```text
PNG Response
```

Calls

```text
writeCreativeBrief.js

↓

generateBackground.js

↓

render.js
```

Dependencies

* Express
* dotenv
* child_process

---

### writeCreativeBrief.js

Purpose

Persist workflow payload.

Responsibilities

* Validate incoming data
* Save `creative-brief.json`

Consumes

```text
HTTP Payload
```

Produces

```text
creative-brief.json
```

---

### generateBackground.js

Purpose

Generate architectural background.

Responsibilities

* Read Creative Brief
* Extract `flux_prompt`
* Authenticate with Hugging Face
* Generate background
* Save PNG

Consumes

```text
creative-brief.json
```

Produces

```text
background.png
```

Dependencies

* Hugging Face
* `.env`

---

### render.js

Purpose

Generate final poster.

Responsibilities

* Read Creative Brief
* Load template
* Inject content
* Load background
* Launch Puppeteer
* Capture PNG

Consumes

```text
creative-brief.json

background.png

poster.html
```

Produces

```text
poster.png
```

---

### poster.html

Purpose

Presentation template.

Contains

* Layout
* Typography
* Positioning

Should NEVER contain

* Business logic

---

### style.css

Purpose

Presentation styling.

Contains

* Fonts
* Colors
* Alignment
* Spacing

---

### creative-brief.json

Purpose

Single Source of Truth.

Generated automatically.

Consumed by

* Background Generator
* Renderer

Never edit manually.

---

### .env

Purpose

Renderer configuration.

Contains

* HF_API_KEY

Never commit.

---

### package.json

Purpose

Renderer dependency management.

---

### docker-compose.yml

Purpose

Run n8n.

Does NOT own Renderer configuration.

---

# Engineering Reference C

Runtime Assets

```text
creative-brief.json

↓

background.png

↓

poster.png
```

Then a table

| Asset               | Generated By          | Consumed By           |
| ------------------- | --------------------- | --------------------- |
| creative-brief.json | writeCreativeBrief.js | Background + Renderer |
| background.png      | generateBackground.js | Renderer              |
| poster.png          | render.js             | HTTP Response         |

---

# Engineering Reference D

Configuration

| File               | Editable | Purpose            |
| ------------------ | -------- | ------------------ |
| .env               | ✅        | Renderer Secrets   |
| package.json       | ✅        | Dependencies       |
| docker-compose.yml | ✅        | n8n Infrastructure |
| poster.html        | ✅        | Template           |
| style.css          | ✅        | Typography         |

