# Engineering Reference G

This is the one you'll probably open the most.

Example

---

## Poster not generated

Check

1.

```text
server.js
```

↓

2.

```text
render.js
```

↓

3.

```text
poster.html
```

↓

4.

Puppeteer

---

## Background missing

Check

```text
HF_API_KEY

↓

generateBackground.js

↓

creative-brief.json

↓

flux_prompt
```

---

## Renderer API failing

Check

```text
server.js

↓

Express

↓

Port 4000

↓

HTTP Node
```

---

## Empty Poster

Check

```text
poster.html

↓

style.css

↓

creative-brief.json
```

