# My final suggestion

I would add one more section.

## Engineering Reference H

### Naming Convention

Example

| Folder    | Responsibility        |
| --------- | --------------------- |
| docker    | Infrastructure        |
| renderer  | Rendering             |
| scripts   | Business Logic        |
| templates | Presentation          |
| temp      | Runtime Assets        |
| input     | Runtime Data          |
| output    | Final Deliverables    |
| docs      | Engineering Knowledge |

This makes it obvious where new files should go as the project grows.

